    "title": "MessengerX App",
    "description": "YOUR APP FOR SPIRITUAL & RELATIONAL GROWTH\r\nMessengerX is a revolutionary tool that connects you with world-class teachers, authors, and leaders that will help you embrace a vibrant faith in your everyday life.\r\n\r\nGROW IN WHAT MATTERS MOST\r\nExplore subjects including: family dynamics, healthy relationships, finding your purpose, freedom from pornography, how to build your faith, hearing from God, business leadership, finances, and much more!\r\n\r\nWATCH. READ. LISTEN.\r\nExplore a rich library of content including courses, ebooks, audiobooks, short films, and more for you to watch, read, and listen.\r\n\r\nGET DISCIPLED, MAKE DISCIPLES\r\nAs a part of MessengerX, you\u2019ll also be helping to provide translated resources to people all over the world.\r\n\r\nSEE YOUR IMPACT\r\nSee exactly how you\u2019re impacting others around the world as you\u2019re being impacted.\r\n\r\n110+ LANGUAGES\r\nInstantly view translated content in over 110 different languages. And we\u2019re continually adding more translated content as we go.\r\n\r\nSHARING\r\nSimple and easy sharing features will help you spread the word to friends and family.\r\n\r\nYOUR GROWTH JOURNEY\r\nMessengerX is here to help you take your next step, so we\u2019ve designed a discipleship journey with powerful tools to help you stay the path.",
    "descriptionHTML": "YOUR APP FOR SPIRITUAL &amp; RELATIONAL GROWTH<br>MessengerX is a revolutionary tool that connects you with world-class teachers, authors, and leaders that will help you embrace a vibrant faith in your everyday life.<br><br>GROW IN WHAT MATTERS MOST<br>Explore subjects including: family dynamics, healthy relationships, finding your purpose, freedom from pornography, how to build your faith, hearing from God, business leadership, finances, and much more!<br><br>WATCH. READ. LISTEN.<br>Explore a rich library of content including courses, ebooks, audiobooks, short films, and more for you to watch, read, and listen.<br><br>GET DISCIPLED, MAKE DISCIPLES<br>As a part of MessengerX, you\u2019ll also be helping to provide translated resources to people all over the world.<br><br>SEE YOUR IMPACT<br>See exactly how you\u2019re impacting others around the world as you\u2019re being impacted.<br><br>110+ LANGUAGES<br>Instantly view translated content in over 110 different languages. And we\u2019re continually adding more translated content as we go.<br><br>SHARING<br>Simple and easy sharing features will help you spread the word to friends and family.<br><br>YOUR GROWTH JOURNEY<br>MessengerX is here to help you take your next step, so we\u2019ve designed a discipleship journey with powerful tools to help you stay the path.",
